          "created_at": "2026-11-09T04:30:09.601Z",
          "cooked": "<p>Thanks for referencing the previous thread, <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/andyx\">@AndyX</a><br>\nI will tag <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/paul_n\">@paul_n</a> for comment (hopefully) re: my questions about stability of the links as versions are deployed. TIA <img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/slight_smile.png?v=16\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
